  planner_response {
    modified_response: "I have successfully completed the full-stack **Mental Health Triage Platform**! \n\nThe application has been unified into a seamless, robust full-stack (Express + React) system. All core features requested have been thoroughly implemented and verified. The code compiles and lints with no errors.\n\nHere is an overview of the key design and functional achievements:\n\n### \360\237\247\240 Server-Side Triage Engine (The Brain)\n- **Secure Gemini Integration**: Configured server-side model interaction via `@google/genai` utilizing `\'gemini-3.5-flash\'` to keep your API keys hidden from the client browser.\n- **Strict JSON Schemas**: Embedded the specific AI Studio System Instructions directly on the backend. This enforces the exact schema requested (`patient_response`, `clinician_summary`, and `crisis_trigger`) while generating professional clinical summaries.\n- **Multimodal Audio Processing**: Implemented direct file stream uploading. Recorded voice journals are analyzed natively by Gemini to produce transcription and triage data.\n- **Graceful Error Recovery**: Initialized the Gemini client lazily. If the API key is not configured in the user secrets panel, the backend will prevent app crashes and return user-friendly instructions in the UI.\n\n### \360\237\216\250 Fully Responsive Dual-Sided Web UI (The Frontend)\n- **Top-Level Toggle Navigation**: Placed a prominent, clean control switcher at the top of the header to flip between the **Patient Portal** and the **Clinician View**.\n- **Patient Portal (Calming, Mobile-First Vibe)**:\n  - Designed a high-contrast theme of calming soft-blues (`slate-50`), pristine whites, and warm indigo highlights.\n  - Included a prominent **Record Voice Journal** button. It uses the standard HTML5 `MediaRecorder` API to capture real-time microphone voice input.\n  - Implemented a **Live Voice Visualizer** using the Web Audio API (`AnalyserNode`) that maps live speech amplitude onto animated waveform bars as you speak.\n  - Created a dual text box (`\"Or type your journal here...\"`) fallback, equipped with helpful character counts and submission skeletons.\n  - Displays non-clinical, empathetic therapeutic validation in a soft text bubble, equipped with a browser **Speech Synthesis (TTS)** play button so patients can listen to response audio.\n- **Clinical Triage Dashboard (Responsive & High-Density Vibe)**:\n  - Created detailed triage analytic widgets showing queue volume and totals mapped by severity levels (*High Crisis, Medium, and Low risk*).\n  - Designed patient triage cards displaying verbatim transcripts, critical 1-3 word primary stressors, detailed professional clinical formulations, and date stamps.\n  - Built-in full search capabilities to scan clinical notes, stressors, and transcripts, paired with risk level buttons to filter the queue.\n  - Added interaction controls like **\"Acknowledge Dispatch\"** and **\"Reset History\"** to update patient states in real-time.\n- **Red Alert Escalation Logic & Crisis Modal**:\n  - If `crisis_trigger` is `true`, the Clinician view turns the card a warnings red, pulsing color, and anchors a bold banner: **\"\342\232\240\357\270\217 Requires Immediate Escalation\"**.\n  - In the Patient Portal, a crisis trigger immediately locks the UI with a full-screen, high-contrast dark overlay.\n  - The modal displays **\"Your safety is our priority.\"** alongside two massive, red hotlink call buttons linking to **Tele MANAS (14416)** and **National Emergency (112)**."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
