  user_input {
    user_response: "Apply the \"Editorial Aesthetic\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Editorial Aesthetic\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML below. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic.\nDesign HTML: <!doctype html>\\n<html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n  <head>\\n    <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n    <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n    <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n    <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n    <style>\\n      body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n      /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n      .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n      .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n      .flex { display: flex; }\\n      .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n      .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n    </style>\\n  </head>\\n  <body>\\n    <div class=\\\"w-[1024px] h-[768px] bg-[#F8F9FA] flex flex-col font-sans overflow-hidden text-[#1A1A1A]\\\"> <header class=\\\"h-16 border-b border-[#E5E5E5] bg-white flex items-center justify-between px-8 shrink-0\\\"> <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\"> <div class=\\\"w-8 h-8 bg-[#4A90E2] rounded-full flex items-center justify-center\\\"> <div class=\\\"w-4 h-4 bg-white rounded-sm rotate-45\\\"></div> </div> <span class=\\\"font-serif italic text-xl tracking-tight\\\">MindPortal <span class=\\\"text-[#A0A0A0] font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-widest ml-2\\\">AI Triage</span></span> </div> <div class=\\\"flex bg-[#F0F2F5] p-1 rounded-full\\\"> <button class=\\\"px-6 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-white shadow-sm\\\">Patient View</button> <button class=\\\"px-6 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold text-[#666]\\\">Clinician View</button> </div> <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-4\\\"> <div class=\\\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#E5E5E5]\\\"></div> </div> </header> <main class=\\\"flex-1 flex overflow-hidden\\\"> <section class=\\\"w-[420px] bg-white border-r border-[#E5E5E5] flex flex-col p-10 justify-between relative\\\"> <div class=\\\"space-y-8\\\"> <div class=\\\"space-y-2\\\"> <h1 class=\\\"font-serif text-4xl leading-tight\\\">Good morning,<br/>Sarah.</h1> <p class=\\\"text-[#666] leading-relaxed\\\">How are you feeling today? Your journal is a safe space for your thoughts.</p> </div> <div class=\\\"space-y-4\\\"> <button class=\\\"w-full group flex flex-col items-center justify-center py-12 border-2 border-dashed border-[#4A90E2] rounded-3xl bg-[#F0F7FF] hover:bg-[#E1EFFF] transition-colors\\\"> <div class=\\\"w-16 h-16 bg-[#4A90E2] rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4 shadow-lg shadow-blue-200\\\"> <div class=\\\"w-4 h-4 bg-white rounded-full\\\"></div> </div> <span class=\\\"text-[#4A90E2] font-semibold tracking-wide\\\">Record Voice Journal</span> <span class=\\\"text-[#4A90E2]/60 text-xs mt-1\\\">Tap to start speaking</span> </button> <div class=\\\"relative\\\"> <textarea placeholder=\\\"Or type your journal here...\\\" class=\\\"w-full h-32 p-4 bg-[#F8F9FA] rounded-2xl border-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-[#4A90E2] resize-none text-sm\\\" readonly></textarea> <button class=\\\"absolute bottom-3 right-3 bg-[#1A1A1A] text-white text-[10px] px-4 py-2 rounded-full font-bold uppercase tracking-wider\\\">Submit to Gemma</button> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\\\"bg-[#F0F7FF] p-4 rounded-2xl border border-[#D0E3F7]\\\"> <p class=\\\"text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest text-[#4A90E2] font-bold mb-2\\\">Gemma\'s Response</p> <p class=\\\"text-sm italic font-serif text-[#334E68] leading-relaxed\\\">\\\"It sounds like you\'ve been carrying a heavy load lately, Sarah. Remember to take a deep breath; you\'re not alone in this.\342\200\235</p> </div> <div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 bg-[#0A0A0A]/95 flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-10 text-center opacity-0 pointer-events-none transition-opacity\\\"> <div class=\\\"w-16 h-16 bg-red-600 rounded-full mb-6 flex items-center justify-center animate-pulse\\\"> <span class=\\\"text-white text-2xl\\\">!</span> </div> <h2 class=\\\"text-white font-serif text-3xl mb-4\\\">Your safety is our priority.</h2> <p class=\\\"text-white/60 text-sm mb-8 max-w-xs\\\">We\'ve detected some signals that suggest you might need immediate support.</p> <div class=\\\"w-full space-y-3\\\"> <button class=\\\"w-full py-4 bg-red-600 text-white rounded-xl font-bold uppercase tracking-widest\\\">Call Tele MANAS (14416)</button> <button class=\\\"w-full py-4 border border-white/20 text-white rounded-xl font-bold uppercase tracking-widest\\\">Emergency (112)</button> </div> </div> </section> <section class=\\\"flex-1 bg-[#F8F9FA] p-10 overflow-hidden flex flex-col\\\"> <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-end mb-8\\\"> <div> <p class=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#A0A0A0] font-bold mb-1\\\">Provider Dashboard</p> <h2 class=\\\"text-2xl font-serif\\\">Recent Triage Cases</h2> </div> <div class=\\\"flex gap-2\\\"> <div class=\\\"px-3 py-1 bg-red-100 text-red-700 text-[10px] font-bold rounded-md border border-red-200 uppercase tracking-wider\\\">1 Crisis Alert</div> <div class=\\\"px-3 py-1 bg-[#1A1A1A] text-white text-[10px] font-bold rounded-md uppercase tracking-wider\\\">Export CSV</div> </div> </div> <div class=\\\"flex-1 grid grid-cols-2 gap-6\\\"> <div class=\\\"bg-white rounded-2xl border border-red-200 shadow-xl shadow-red-50/50 flex flex-col overflow-hidden\\\"> <div class=\\\"bg-red-600 px-4 py-2 flex justify-between items-center\\\"> <span class=\\\"text-[10px] text-white font-bold uppercase tracking-widest\\\">Requires Immediate Escalation</span> <span class=\\\"text-[10px] text-white/80 font-mono\\\">ID: #8821</span> </div> <div class=\\\"p-6 flex-1 space-y-4\\\"> <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-start\\\"> <div class=\\\"space-y-1\\\"> <p class=\\\"text-[10px] text-[#A0A0A0] uppercase font-bold\\\">Patient Name</p> <p class=\\\"font-serif text-lg\\\">Arjun V.</p> </div> <div class=\\\"text-right\\\"> <p class=\\\"text-[10px] text-[#A0A0A0] uppercase font-bold\\\">Risk Level</p> <p class=\\\"text-red-600 font-bold text-sm\\\">CRITICAL</p> </div> </div> <div class=\\\"h-px bg-[#F0F0F0]\\\"></div> <div> <p class=\\\"text-[10px] text-[#A0A0A0] uppercase font-bold mb-2\\\">Primary Stressor</p> <span class=\\\"px-2 py-1 bg-red-50 text-red-700 text-xs font-medium rounded border border-red-100\\\">Self-Harm Intent</span> </div> <div> <p class=\\\"text-[10px] text-[#A0A0A0] uppercase font-bold mb-1\\\">Clinical Notes</p> <p class=\\\"text-xs text-[#444] leading-relaxed italic\\\">Patient explicitly mentions plan for self-harm tonight. Speech pattern indicates acute distress and high urgency.</p> </div> <div> <p class=\\\"text-[10px] text-[#A0A0A0] uppercase font-bold mb-1\\\">Transcript Fragment</p> <p class=\\\"text-[11px] font-mono text-[#666] bg-[#F9F9F9] p-3 rounded-lg border border-[#EEE]\\\">\\\"...I just can\'t do this anymore. I\'ve made up my mind for tonight. I\'m sorry.\342\200\235</p> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\\\"bg-white rounded-2xl border border-[#E5E5E5] shadow-sm flex flex-col\\\"> <div class=\\\"p-6 flex-1 space-y-4 opacity-80\\\"> <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-start\\\"> <div class=\\\"space-y-1\\\"> <p class=\\\"text-[10px] text-[#A0A0A0] uppercase font-bold\\\">Patient Name</p> <p class=\\\"font-serif text-lg\\\">Maria G.</p> </div> <div class=\\\"text-right\\\"> <p class=\\\"text-[10px] text-[#A0A0A0] uppercase font-bold\\\">Risk Level</p> <p class=\\\"text-orange-500 font-bold text-sm\\\">MEDIUM</p> </div> </div> <div class=\\\"h-px bg-[#F0F0F0]\\\"></div> <div> <p class=\\\"text-[10px] text-[#A0A0A0] uppercase font-bold mb-2\\\">Primary Stressor</p> <span class=\\\"px-2 py-1 bg-orange-50 text-orange-700 text-xs font-medium rounded border border-orange-100\\\">Work Exhaustion</span> </div> <div> <p class=\\\"text-[10px] text-[#A0A0A0] uppercase font-bold mb-1\\\">Clinical Notes</p> <p class=\\\"text-xs text-[#444] leading-relaxed\\\">Signs of moderate burnout. Sleep hygiene is poor. Needs follow-up for anxiety management.</p> </div> <div class=\\\"pt-4\\\"> <button class=\\\"w-full py-2 bg-[#F0F2F5] text-[#1A1A1A] text-[10px] font-bold rounded-lg uppercase tracking-widest hover:bg-[#E5E7EB]\\\">Review Full File</button> </div> </div> </div> </div> </section> </main> </div>\\n  </body>\\n</html>\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
    items {
      text: "Apply the \"Editorial Aesthetic\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Editorial Aesthetic\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML below. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic.\nDesign HTML: <!doctype html>\\n<html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n  <head>\\n    <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n    <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n    <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n    <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n    <style>\\n      body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n      /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n      .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n      .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n      .flex { display: flex; }\\n      .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n      .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n    </style>\\n  </head>\\n  <body>\\n    <div class=\\\"w-[1024px] h-[768px] bg-[#F8F9FA] flex flex-col font-sans overflow-hidden text-[#1A1A1A]\\\"> <header class=\\\"h-16 border-b border-[#E5E5E5] bg-white flex items-center justify-between px-8 shrink-0\\\"> <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\"> <div class=\\\"w-8 h-8 bg-[#4A90E2] rounded-full flex items-center justify-center\\\"> <div class=\\\"w-4 h-4 bg-white rounded-sm rotate-45\\\"></div> </div> <span class=\\\"font-serif italic text-xl tracking-tight\\\">MindPortal <span class=\\\"text-[#A0A0A0] font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-widest ml-2\\\">AI Triage</span></span> </div> <div class=\\\"flex bg-[#F0F2F5] p-1 rounded-full\\\"> <button class=\\\"px-6 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-white shadow-sm\\\">Patient View</button> <button class=\\\"px-6 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold text-[#666]\\\">Clinician View</button> </div> <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-4\\\"> <div class=\\\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#E5E5E5]\\\"></div> </div> </header> <main class=\\\"flex-1 flex overflow-hidden\\\"> <section class=\\\"w-[420px] bg-white border-r border-[#E5E5E5] flex flex-col p-10 justify-between relative\\\"> <div class=\\\"space-y-8\\\"> <div class=\\\"space-y-2\\\"> <h1 class=\\\"font-serif text-4xl leading-tight\\\">Good morning,<br/>Sarah.</h1> <p class=\\\"text-[#666] leading-relaxed\\\">How are you feeling today? Your journal is a safe space for your thoughts.</p> </div> <div class=\\\"space-y-4\\\"> <button class=\\\"w-full group flex flex-col items-center justify-center py-12 border-2 border-dashed border-[#4A90E2] rounded-3xl bg-[#F0F7FF] hover:bg-[#E1EFFF] transition-colors\\\"> <div class=\\\"w-16 h-16 bg-[#4A90E2] rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4 shadow-lg shadow-blue-200\\\"> <div class=\\\"w-4 h-4 bg-white rounded-full\\\"></div> </div> <span class=\\\"text-[#4A90E2] font-semibold tracking-wide\\\">Record Voice Journal</span> <span class=\\\"text-[#4A90E2]/60 text-xs mt-1\\\">Tap to start speaking</span> </button> <div class=\\\"relative\\\"> <textarea placeholder=\\\"Or type your journal here...\\\" class=\\\"w-full h-32 p-4 bg-[#F8F9FA] rounded-2xl border-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-[#4A90E2] resize-none text-sm\\\" readonly></textarea> <button class=\\\"absolute bottom-3 right-3 bg-[#1A1A1A] text-white text-[10px] px-4 py-2 rounded-full font-bold uppercase tracking-wider\\\">Submit to Gemma</button> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\\\"bg-[#F0F7FF] p-4 rounded-2xl border border-[#D0E3F7]\\\"> <p class=\\\"text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest text-[#4A90E2] font-bold mb-2\\\">Gemma\'s Response</p> <p class=\\\"text-sm italic font-serif text-[#334E68] leading-relaxed\\\">\\\"It sounds like you\'ve been carrying a heavy load lately, Sarah. Remember to take a deep breath; you\'re not alone in this.\342\200\235</p> </div> <div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 bg-[#0A0A0A]/95 flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-10 text-center opacity-0 pointer-events-none transition-opacity\\\"> <div class=\\\"w-16 h-16 bg-red-600 rounded-full mb-6 flex items-center justify-center animate-pulse\\\"> <span class=\\\"text-white text-2xl\\\">!</span> </div> <h2 class=\\\"text-white font-serif text-3xl mb-4\\\">Your safety is our priority.</h2> <p class=\\\"text-white/60 text-sm mb-8 max-w-xs\\\">We\'ve detected some signals that suggest you might need immediate support.</p> <div class=\\\"w-full space-y-3\\\"> <button class=\\\"w-full py-4 bg-red-600 text-white rounded-xl font-bold uppercase tracking-widest\\\">Call Tele MANAS (14416)</button> <button class=\\\"w-full py-4 border border-white/20 text-white rounded-xl font-bold uppercase tracking-widest\\\">Emergency (112)</button> </div> </div> </section> <section class=\\\"flex-1 bg-[#F8F9FA] p-10 overflow-hidden flex flex-col\\\"> <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-end mb-8\\\"> <div> <p class=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#A0A0A0] font-bold mb-1\\\">Provider Dashboard</p> <h2 class=\\\"text-2xl font-serif\\\">Recent Triage Cases</h2> </div> <div class=\\\"flex gap-2\\\"> <div class=\\\"px-3 py-1 bg-red-100 text-red-700 text-[10px] font-bold rounded-md border border-red-200 uppercase tracking-wider\\\">1 Crisis Alert</div> <div class=\\\"px-3 py-1 bg-[#1A1A1A] text-white text-[10px] font-bold rounded-md uppercase tracking-wider\\\">Export CSV</div> </div> </div> <div class=\\\"flex-1 grid grid-cols-2 gap-6\\\"> <div class=\\\"bg-white rounded-2xl border border-red-200 shadow-xl shadow-red-50/50 flex flex-col overflow-hidden\\\"> <div class=\\\"bg-red-600 px-4 py-2 flex justify-between items-center\\\"> <span class=\\\"text-[10px] text-white font-bold uppercase tracking-widest\\\">Requires Immediate Escalation</span> <span class=\\\"text-[10px] text-white/80 font-mono\\\">ID: #8821</span> </div> <div class=\\\"p-6 flex-1 space-y-4\\\"> <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-start\\\"> <div class=\\\"space-y-1\\\"> <p class=\\\"text-[10px] text-[#A0A0A0] uppercase font-bold\\\">Patient Name</p> <p class=\\\"font-serif text-lg\\\">Arjun V.</p> </div> <div class=\\\"text-right\\\"> <p class=\\\"text-[10px] text-[#A0A0A0] uppercase font-bold\\\">Risk Level</p> <p class=\\\"text-red-600 font-bold text-sm\\\">CRITICAL</p> </div> </div> <div class=\\\"h-px bg-[#F0F0F0]\\\"></div> <div> <p class=\\\"text-[10px] text-[#A0A0A0] uppercase font-bold mb-2\\\">Primary Stressor</p> <span class=\\\"px-2 py-1 bg-red-50 text-red-700 text-xs font-medium rounded border border-red-100\\\">Self-Harm Intent</span> </div> <div> <p class=\\\"text-[10px] text-[#A0A0A0] uppercase font-bold mb-1\\\">Clinical Notes</p> <p class=\\\"text-xs text-[#444] leading-relaxed italic\\\">Patient explicitly mentions plan for self-harm tonight. Speech pattern indicates acute distress and high urgency.</p> </div> <div> <p class=\\\"text-[10px] text-[#A0A0A0] uppercase font-bold mb-1\\\">Transcript Fragment</p> <p class=\\\"text-[11px] font-mono text-[#666] bg-[#F9F9F9] p-3 rounded-lg border border-[#EEE]\\\">\\\"...I just can\'t do this anymore. I\'ve made up my mind for tonight. I\'m sorry.\342\200\235</p> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\\\"bg-white rounded-2xl border border-[#E5E5E5] shadow-sm flex flex-col\\\"> <div class=\\\"p-6 flex-1 space-y-4 opacity-80\\\"> <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-start\\\"> <div class=\\\"space-y-1\\\"> <p class=\\\"text-[10px] text-[#A0A0A0] uppercase font-bold\\\">Patient Name</p> <p class=\\\"font-serif text-lg\\\">Maria G.</p> </div> <div class=\\\"text-right\\\"> <p class=\\\"text-[10px] text-[#A0A0A0] uppercase font-bold\\\">Risk Level</p> <p class=\\\"text-orange-500 font-bold text-sm\\\">MEDIUM</p> </div> </div> <div class=\\\"h-px bg-[#F0F0F0]\\\"></div> <div> <p class=\\\"text-[10px] text-[#A0A0A0] uppercase font-bold mb-2\\\">Primary Stressor</p> <span class=\\\"px-2 py-1 bg-orange-50 text-orange-700 text-xs font-medium rounded border border-orange-100\\\">Work Exhaustion</span> </div> <div> <p class=\\\"text-[10px] text-[#A0A0A0] uppercase font-bold mb-1\\\">Clinical Notes</p> <p class=\\\"text-xs text-[#444] leading-relaxed\\\">Signs of moderate burnout. Sleep hygiene is poor. Needs follow-up for anxiety management.</p> </div> <div class=\\\"pt-4\\\"> <button class=\\\"w-full py-2 bg-[#F0F2F5] text-[#1A1A1A] text-[10px] font-bold rounded-lg uppercase tracking-widest hover:bg-[#E5E7EB]\\\">Review Full File</button> </div> </div> </div> </div> </section> </main> </div>\\n  </body>\\n</html>\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
