    summary: "Gemma-4-E4B-it is an instruction-tuned model from the Gemma 4 family, developed by Google DeepMind, and is available on Google Cloud\'s Vertex AI platform. The \"E4B\" in its name signifies an \"effective 4B\" parameter model, indicating its optimization for efficient performance on edge and mobile devices[1][2][3][4][5].\n\nKey characteristics and functionalities of Gemma-4-E4B-it and the broader Gemma 4 family on Google Cloud include:\n*   **Multimodality** Gemma 4 models are multimodal, capable of processing both text and image inputs. The E2B and E4B variants specifically support native audio input for tasks like speech recognition and understanding[1][6][2][7][4][5][8].\n*   **Core Capabilities** They excel in advanced reasoning, support long context windows (up to 128K tokens for E2B/E4B models), and offer enhanced capabilities for coding and agentic workflows, including native function-calling and structured JSON output[1][6][2][3][4][5][8].\n*   **Vertex AI Integration** Gemma 4 models, including Gemma-4-E4B-it, are available in the Vertex AI Model Garden. This allows developers to easily deploy these models to Vertex AI endpoints, manage them, and perform fine-tuning using Vertex AI Training Clusters (VTC)[9][10][11][12][7][13].\n*   **Deployment Options** Beyond Vertex AI, Gemma 4 models can be deployed on other Google Cloud services like Cloud Run and Google Kubernetes Engine (GKE)[9][10][12][6]. They are also optimized to run efficiently on various hardware, including NVIDIA GPUs, AMD GPUs, Google Cloud TPUs, and Intel Xeon 6 CPUs, as well as on-device for mobile and IoT applications[9][1][6][2][3][4][8].\n*   **Open and Accessible** Gemma 4 models are released with open weights under a commercially permissive Apache 2.0 license, making them accessible for customization and deployment in various projects and applications[10][6][3].\n\nSources:\n[1] [huggingface.co](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHAruPKtQoOcDs3vOMFMP4aujmxgY6nfJFXrmF8S0wfPC9w-kHl1g28ikC5DzC5dfuNPMu_iJqS93sZ2dTPaeyYFFDef2YFlYewUTCyY45E22-cYwZlLL-ZguASowVqNxrlEAuSDRqv)\n[2] [lmstudio.ai](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGlq2G93PhavI2_M_pP5Fk-yLjK1asHEPGCtWqlmnVUAB1ly6u54IklJ302PLQFgWz4OmgqEw3tXbcqBJNj4wglfAPyBQDTJDW_DVC53pj7CwIUGZtu1tWNIVdiVzLsHdD1UdOUmYj72g==)\n[3] [google.dev](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQG82WpaYtjXdD4VBSrrXPHLXUDA8iTvu6ojWkI6rfOH0fcBeqy6bnJ4sgxvzsyR9abdNOvJT9xzUNoYaQl96EisSGuaaG9FTHQ4dnNkvxcMC7lA1lEZ12wCINSwYNKiE9U=)\n[4] [nvidia.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFyunMh83XuF-3VTNMwdSJBOmdtopNsIdep_4b_n23p_wd7daPZLeC09aJCS2E3d7LEFduo1ZPWCV_AILSOeMpBuyvdW92Uww_QMnkQd48_znBaV5Q7v1gQUrNzfMXw-pynyrOCCXH53JUsm3XHH9Ef639b0lYtjE_jnyGgYZfxRRemlMXVmCJKST2m54caBJZxrbahXf_N)\n[5] [mindstudio.ai](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHKcUKl4C00TY4hBbPZKP7HGwnpDtPrBlMI81MiTtN_vjLAjfxD36DnVp9_dapFrp0oESYopZkPJYxVNISvHdJaRZshFxQqAs_As-POBnfBpToOoPhqwE7aYjbCCARGy7fD2E6oFh69_iHQNYqHU_5FNtHhhHoIewm9HRGtKW-9mkrYrzjuAuUWTouL)\n[6] [blog.google](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFV5HR4R3GB2m_QJ3OfkaXxfgDlsduvmu0D5ODZJ173Kfb4d7tiZuiN5Mv-ZSXra36iCGxH4GK_2De5ENmYXFO5785ySD2Wmwe50eqsDy3o1axhWiPSIa3CMhdcOjBxRYkN8Xi6uyfMSwyjSufkKZaHhXyWUhyZx5VmcI7m7aI10XTEJhIb)\n[7] [huggingface.co](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFKEd2GNN-XSwoudiYW6tABYqY0QICa6_iJ4DC0C60uwYpWUJE_QnzFSOGnh20Vv6U4O0cR3uyMNYdnaw_9GezVjj29DVu7iar08z3ACqMMAb0-I-XgTff8hR_tXsaN7tYnKQjwB-A46kV3TCs4algDicHyrTCMXb-csYQ7lniK-qSRLsxjT2y4G8MlbRz0XsQA7g==)\n[8] [vllm.ai](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFi3VPghcR1xelhKyJRU-QbQgdJHf3RxHgsMnW2MYV1huWxe7gigEI3gR7BGehnbwVnp7Mi8wFy53EVOYjkcdvvF8ybUtH4Bq4Ltj8Hlj3ArpZnFYTDt-8p5mE5rDdfnzEMzPDKoWqNCms2HplihtAuzquBpGqsO2-9HWuVmA==)\n[9] [google.com](https://vertex